  "behavior": "It patrols the waters of the Skunk Pond in search of food. It attacks creatures it considers prey and may chase them down to swallow them.",
  "interactionWithPlayer": "It is extremely dangerous and cannot be killed. If it detects the player, it can pursue them and use attacks that deal enormous damage, so fighting it directly is not an option.",
  "interactionWithCreatures": "It is one of the pond's main predators and shows a particular preference for tadpoles, which it may chase and devour.",
